## 2. Room Persistence & Auto-Migrations

* **Room Entities & DAOs:** Always write DAOs with suspend functions or reactive Flows:
  ```kotlin
  @Dao
  interface ItemDao {
      @Query("SELECT * FROM items WHERE is_active = 1 ORDER BY timestamp DESC")
      fun observeActiveItems(): Flow<List<ItemEntity>>

      @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)
      suspend fun upsertItems(items: List<ItemEntity>)
  }
  ```
* **Auto-Migrations:** Declare automated schema migrations between version increments:
  ```kotlin
  @Database(
      version = 2,
      entities = [ItemEntity::class],
      autoMigrations = [AutoMigration(from = 1, to = 2)]
  )
  abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase()
  ```

