## 3. Type-Safe Navigation 2.8+ Kotlin DSL

Ditch string route concatenations (`"details/{id}"`). Use type-safe serializable destinations:
```kotlin
@Serializable
data object HomeRoute

@Serializable
data class DetailRoute(val itemId: String, val fromSearch: Boolean)

// NavHost setup:
NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = HomeRoute) {
    composable<HomeRoute> {
        HomeScreen(onItemClick = { id -> navController.navigate(DetailRoute(id, true)) })
    }
    composable<DetailRoute> { backStackEntry ->
        val route: DetailRoute = backStackEntry.toRoute()
        DetailScreen(itemId = route.itemId)
    }
}
```

