## 4. WorkManager for Battery-Conscious Deferred Tasks

For sync, telemetry uploads, or image processing that must survive app death or reboot:
* Use `CoroutineWorker`.
* Set strict network and battery constraints:
  ```kotlin
  val constraints = Constraints.Builder()
      .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.UNMETERED)
      .setRequiresBatteryNotLow(true)
      .build()
  ```
